## 1. Admin

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "real922548@gmail.com",
  "password": "Tonkla25488",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Signup / Register (ได้ 200 เฉพาะตอน DB ยังไม่มี admin — Strapi block "You cannot register a new super admin")
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "real922548@gmail.com",
  "password": "Tonkla25488",
  "firstname": "Sanchai",
  "lastname": "Tangjai"
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "real922548@gmail.com"
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password
### token ต้องตรงกับค่าใน DB (single-use / ขั้น 1.3 สุ่ม token ใหม่ทับเสมอ) — ถ้า 400 ให้รัน:
### powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/seed-reset-tokens.ps1
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resetPasswordToken": "e5fc350a24aef7a8c50342e3df6b5d4bdf11b75d",
  "password": "Tonkla25488"
}

