## 2. User

### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "real922548@gmail.com",
  "password": "Tonkla2548"
}

### 2.2 Signup / Register (username/email สุ่มด้วย {{$guid}} => ได้ 200 ทุกครั้ง)
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sanchai-{{$guid}}",
  "email": "{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "password": "Tonkla2548"
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "real922548@gmail.com"
}

### 2.3.1 Reset Password
### code ต้องตรงกับค่าใน DB (single-use / ขั้น 2.3 สุ่ม code ใหม่ทับเสมอ) — ถ้า 400 ให้รัน:
### powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/seed-reset-tokens.ps1
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "22952c04acca759ede1d44a45fe9ab2e8d8041f89f58706c76312c84a17ad9121dc3d11f4fd83fe48c8691931b96d1ba4f0b22b1e9cd0b87ca5a28ab07301e59",
  "password": "Tonkla2548",
  "passwordConfirmation": "Tonkla2548"
}

